          "text": "Right eye reported symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Growth first noticed a couple of years ago and slowly increasing; more noticeable over the last 6–9 months, intermittently irritated and scratchy, especially at the end of workdays and on windy days, with mild redness and dryness. Right eye may be a little blurrier when tired; vision is otherwise okay for phone use and driving."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
